{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04490","headline":"万州晓发放舟乘涨还寄蜀中亲朋 · 陈子昂","name":"万州晓发放舟乘涨还寄蜀中亲朋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空蒙岩雨霁，烂熳晓云归。\n啸旅乘明发，奔桡骛断矶。\n苍茫林岫转，络绎涨涛飞。\n远岸孤烟出，遥峰曙日微。\n前瞻未能眴，坐望已相依。\n曲直多今古，经过失是非。\n还期方浩浩，征思日騑騑。\n寄谢千金子，江海事多违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}